WEBVTT

00:00:05.650 --> 00:00:12.570
<b>I tried coming alone to our usual park.</b>

00:00:13.500 --> 00:00:16.070
<b>It's a feeling I've never felt.</b>

00:00:16.070 --> 00:00:21.660
<b>Like a child, frightened by the sound of the wind</b>

00:00:21.660 --> 00:00:25.670
<b>I ran back along the path home.</b>

00:00:27.840 --> 00:00:33.970
<b>The sky outside the window is too vast. Where are you now?</b>

00:00:34.340 --> 00:00:36.130
<b>Please, may this reach you...</b>

00:00:38.410 --> 00:00:44.690
<b>Dear Lord, if you ever grant wishes,</b>

00:00:44.690 --> 00:00:50.110
<b>grant my wish right now, please!</b>

00:00:50.350 --> 00:00:56.240
<b>I want to hear your voice, I miss you! I want to see you now!</b>

00:00:56.240 --> 00:01:00.830
<b>Why must you already be looking toward tomorrow?</b>

00:01:00.830 --> 00:01:06.210
<b>Don't just brush it off, saying the time has slipped by.</b>

00:01:06.210 --> 00:01:08.540
<b>Once more...</b>

00:01:08.540 --> 00:01:14.550
<b>I love you, and yet it's been too late since long ago.</b>

00:01:14.550 --> 00:01:19.140
<b>Even if I give up, it can't be like the past.</b>

00:01:19.140 --> 00:01:24.350
<b>Don't just decide so simply there's no way, no choice.</b>

00:01:24.350 --> 00:01:28.230
<b>Smile once more.</b>

00:01:38.580 --> 00:01:41.530
It'll be okay. I can do this.

00:01:43.450 --> 00:01:45.790
Heroman...

00:01:46.060 --> 00:01:48.770
Go!

00:01:50.680 --> 00:01:53.460
We're counting on you, Joey, Heroman!

00:02:42.290 --> 00:02:43.510
<i>Joey, can you hear me?</i>

00:02:44.430 --> 00:02:46.010
<i>Things have taken a turn for the worse.</i>

00:02:46.260 --> 00:02:49.940
That plantlike substance X creature has 
embedded itself throughout the city,

00:02:50.200 --> 00:02:52.570
and it's continuing to spread 
out in all directions!

00:02:53.340 --> 00:02:57.390
The military has put up a defense, 
trying to stop its progress,

00:02:57.390 --> 00:03:00.240
but I don't think we can rely much on that.

00:03:07.990 --> 00:03:12.710
And with the well-being of the President 
at the White House still in question,

00:03:12.710 --> 00:03:16.250
a large-scale attack from the 
government is out of the question.

00:03:16.710 --> 00:03:21.260
But if we just leave them be, 
they'll devour the entire planet!

00:03:22.210 --> 00:03:24.550
<i>We have to do something 
before that happens...</i>

00:03:24.720 --> 00:03:29.270
<i>Please, make the plan to rescue the President,
Operation Thunderbird, a success!</i>

00:03:29.270 --> 00:03:32.350
<i>We're counting on you, Joey, Heroman!</i>

00:03:35.530 --> 00:03:39.480
...says you. So what the 
hell's goin' on here?

00:03:42.800 --> 00:03:46.960
Don't really know, but we're 
goin' after Joey or something.

00:03:46.960 --> 00:03:48.590
I've heard about it from this girly here.

00:03:49.520 --> 00:03:51.800
I have something I need 
to talk with Joey about.

00:03:51.800 --> 00:03:54.570
Even if you tell me to go home, 
I'm not going back, no way!

00:03:54.570 --> 00:03:56.790
We're not going for fun and games, you know!

00:03:57.040 --> 00:04:00.140
And what did you tell 
your parents about this?

00:04:01.110 --> 00:04:01.840
Whatever!

00:04:05.020 --> 00:04:06.510
Give me a break...

00:04:08.480 --> 00:04:11.450
Say something to them, Professor!

00:04:11.450 --> 00:04:17.260
Well, having another person along might 
come in handy during a crisis, I suppose.

00:04:17.260 --> 00:04:19.970
Why are you so calm about this?

00:04:19.970 --> 00:04:21.740
Why not?

00:04:21.740 --> 00:04:26.830
Having another person there to pick up Joey 
after everything's done would be lovely.

00:04:27.100 --> 00:04:28.490
Don't you think?

00:04:30.120 --> 00:04:32.040
Give me a break!

00:04:33.050 --> 00:04:35.030
What's with these people?

00:04:37.490 --> 00:04:40.870
So what are we planning on doing, then?

00:04:41.540 --> 00:04:46.460
We've gotten the complete support 
of the government now, see.

00:04:46.460 --> 00:04:48.180
There's quite a lot that we can do.

00:04:50.460 --> 00:04:51.840
Quite a lot, indeed...

00:05:01.700 --> 00:05:03.220
Things are proceeding well.

00:05:03.220 --> 00:05:07.370
At this rate, work will be complete shortly.

00:05:07.910 --> 00:05:12.140
Soon there will be no one 
left that can oppose us.

00:05:12.440 --> 00:05:15.160
Yes, no one at all...

00:05:47.640 --> 00:05:52.110
Heroman's power armor that the NIA 
made at the Professor's direction...

00:05:52.880 --> 00:05:57.250
The manual said that it amplifies 
Heroman's electrical powers, but...

00:06:21.970 --> 00:06:22.900
Wow!

00:06:25.780 --> 00:06:29.650
With this we might make it to the 
epicenter faster than I thought!

00:06:33.670 --> 00:06:36.190
A helicopter? Mr. Hughes?

00:06:38.070 --> 00:06:38.870
That's...

00:06:39.120 --> 00:06:40.830
Hiyas!

00:06:41.170 --> 00:06:43.800
Wherever there's trouble, I'm there!

00:06:43.800 --> 00:06:46.300
Wherever you find Heroman, I'm there!

00:06:47.800 --> 00:06:52.180
The All American Network reporter, 
Keisha Jackson, is on the scene!

00:06:52.740 --> 00:06:55.100
Start the relay! Is everything set?

00:06:55.410 --> 00:06:56.680
Anytime you're ready.

00:06:59.440 --> 00:07:01.690
That's Ms. Keisha from the other time!

00:07:11.750 --> 00:07:13.360
Whoa!

00:07:13.700 --> 00:07:15.370
They're the real deal!

00:07:16.500 --> 00:07:21.170
Those bombers... Are they leaving 
at your request, Prof. Denton?

00:07:21.170 --> 00:07:23.700
Yeah, basically.

00:07:23.700 --> 00:07:29.380
But is bombing the Skrugg 
going to accomplish anything?

00:07:29.380 --> 00:07:31.450
They're not going to bomb anything.

00:07:31.450 --> 00:07:34.260
I wouldn't be using my brain power at all

00:07:34.260 --> 00:07:37.450
if the only thing I was thinking 
of doing was attacking the enemy.

00:07:37.450 --> 00:07:39.080
Then, what are they for?

00:07:39.080 --> 00:07:42.390
For helping Joey and Heroman, of course!

00:07:42.390 --> 00:07:43.920
Help them?

00:07:44.330 --> 00:07:46.340
Do you two remember?

00:07:46.340 --> 00:07:52.610
Do you remember why Heroman got into a 
jam when he fought that robot, the MR-1?

00:07:55.960 --> 00:07:57.450
He ran out of energy!

00:07:57.700 --> 00:07:59.400
Exactly!

00:07:59.400 --> 00:08:04.500
Back then he managed to get through 
it thanks to that power plant.

00:08:04.500 --> 00:08:07.320
But it didn't have to go so well, really.

00:08:07.320 --> 00:08:08.210
I see.

00:08:08.480 --> 00:08:12.750
And this battle is sure to be a long one.

00:08:13.090 --> 00:08:18.250
Even with the power amplification parts 
I designed, his power is not infinite.

00:08:19.030 --> 00:08:20.470
I got ya!

00:08:20.470 --> 00:08:24.960
You're saying that we'll be in "charge" 
of Heroman's refueling, right?

00:08:25.230 --> 00:08:26.650
Exactly!

00:08:27.360 --> 00:08:29.370
But, how?

00:08:29.800 --> 00:08:32.430
You'll just have to look 
forward to it when you see it.

00:08:32.430 --> 00:08:33.970
Oh, give it a rest.

00:08:33.970 --> 00:08:39.730
In order for us to accomplish this goal, I've 
gotten my hands on the best possible equipment.

00:08:41.290 --> 00:08:46.830
His heart may be clouded, but Dr. 
Minami is truly a genius scientist!

00:08:48.860 --> 00:08:50.450
That's...

00:08:53.810 --> 00:08:55.720
Okay... Things are gonna get busy now.

00:08:58.700 --> 00:09:02.240
Please look at this! Can 
you tell where we are?

00:09:02.240 --> 00:09:06.550
This is what the area surrounding 
the White House looks like now!

00:09:06.550 --> 00:09:11.150
Who could have ever predicted witnessing 
a transformation like this?

00:09:14.910 --> 00:09:16.050
Watch out!

00:09:22.900 --> 00:09:27.800
Everyone, we've just come under 
attack from the mysterious creature!

00:09:27.800 --> 00:09:29.740
We're under attack!

00:09:30.070 --> 00:09:32.250
I can't fight like this.

00:09:33.330 --> 00:09:35.340
Mr. Hughes, can you hear me?

00:09:36.810 --> 00:09:37.700
<i>What's wrong?</i>

00:09:39.460 --> 00:09:42.690
There's a helicopter! A 
TV helicopter is here!

00:09:42.690 --> 00:09:43.430
<i>What?</i>

00:09:51.740 --> 00:09:53.720
Can you do something about it?

00:09:57.060 --> 00:09:58.320
Here we go!

00:09:58.770 --> 00:10:02.330
Understood. You guys 
concentrate on the battle.

00:10:03.090 --> 00:10:05.740
Honestly... Who in the world?

00:10:09.400 --> 00:10:11.100
Her again?

00:10:12.570 --> 00:10:16.530
Open up a line to the helicopter in the 
airspace above the White House, now!

00:10:16.530 --> 00:10:19.050
But don't worry, everyone!

00:10:19.050 --> 00:10:24.030
Everyone's hero, Heroman, is 
rushing toward the White House

00:10:24.030 --> 00:10:27.850
to save the President and 
officials at this very moment!

00:10:29.990 --> 00:10:32.100
We're in the middle of a broadcast!

00:10:32.100 --> 00:10:34.300
Yeah, I know, but...

00:10:35.950 --> 00:10:38.960
Well, let's go back to the studio for a bit!

00:10:40.850 --> 00:10:42.300
What?!

00:10:42.300 --> 00:10:45.060
An emergency message from the government...

00:10:45.060 --> 00:10:46.860
Just ignore it.

00:10:46.860 --> 00:10:50.370
Uh, they said they'll shoot 
us down if we don't answer...

00:10:52.470 --> 00:10:55.220
I'll talk to 'em. Switch over.

00:10:55.870 --> 00:10:57.760
<i>What the hell are you thinking?!</i>

00:10:57.760 --> 00:11:00.680
<i>The airspace here is 
already a restricted area!</i>

00:11:00.680 --> 00:11:03.640
We're riskin' our lives 
out here for this scoop!

00:11:03.640 --> 00:11:07.500
I don't know who you are, but you 
have no right to tell us to leave!

00:11:07.500 --> 00:11:09.180
<i>Move away from the area immediately!</i>

00:11:09.180 --> 00:11:10.480
<i>If you don't we'll shoot you down!</i>

00:11:10.480 --> 00:11:13.080
Go ahead and do it, then.

00:11:13.080 --> 00:11:19.700
Just consider the pressure you'll face from 
having that exposed on a live national broadcast.

00:11:27.350 --> 00:11:32.120
<i>Heroman cannot fight freely with you there.</i>

00:11:33.110 --> 00:11:37.660
<i>If you feel any sort of responsibility, 
please leave the area immediately.</i>

00:11:38.270 --> 00:11:40.170
Because of us?

00:11:42.360 --> 00:11:46.720
Then tell Heroman he 
shouldn't worry about us!

00:11:46.970 --> 00:11:49.000
If that would work I wouldn't 
have contacted you!

00:11:49.000 --> 00:11:51.690
If it's his duty to fight,

00:11:51.690 --> 00:11:54.690
then it's our duty to report!

00:11:54.690 --> 00:11:58.440
We have an obligation 
to report the truth about him!

00:11:58.990 --> 00:12:02.900
We're already prepared to give 
our lives for that cause!

00:12:02.900 --> 00:12:04.820
That's all! Over and out!

00:12:04.820 --> 00:12:06.610
Hey, wait...

00:12:16.050 --> 00:12:16.940
<i>Joey!</i>

00:12:16.940 --> 00:12:18.050
Mr. Hughes!

00:12:18.050 --> 00:12:20.740
<i>Sorry... Just forget about it up there.</i>

00:12:20.740 --> 00:12:22.760
W-What's that supposed to mean?

00:12:22.760 --> 00:12:25.280
<i>They said that they'll take responsibility 
for anything that happens.</i>

00:12:25.570 --> 00:12:27.810
<i>So don't worry about them, and fight!</i>

00:12:27.810 --> 00:12:30.260
It's because I can't do that I 
asked you in the first place!

00:12:32.500 --> 00:12:34.830
<i>They don't seem like they'll budge.</i>

00:12:34.830 --> 00:12:39.940
<i>Instead of wasting time worrying about them, 
head to the White House as fast as you can!</i>

00:12:41.400 --> 00:12:42.470
<i>Joey...</i>

00:12:42.470 --> 00:12:45.590
<i>Joey, now is not the time to be 
worrying about single individuals...</i>

00:12:46.590 --> 00:12:49.240
Saving the entire world is more important!

00:12:56.920 --> 00:12:57.880
Heroman!

00:13:12.020 --> 00:13:17.050
Heroman is now breaking through into 
the central area of the mysterious creature!

00:13:17.880 --> 00:13:19.360
Hold it a second...

00:13:19.360 --> 00:13:20.700
Get a shot of that!

00:13:23.820 --> 00:13:26.110
That's... a young boy!

00:13:27.800 --> 00:13:30.300
There's a young boy right next to Heroman!

00:13:31.410 --> 00:13:34.390
The boy is working together with Heroman!

00:13:47.470 --> 00:13:49.780
What is the meaning of this?

00:13:49.780 --> 00:13:52.800
Who in the world is this young boy?

00:13:53.350 --> 00:13:54.970
Get that shot over there!

00:13:59.090 --> 00:14:00.160
That's...

00:14:00.160 --> 00:14:01.310
Joey?

00:14:01.580 --> 00:14:05.100
<i>The boy is not afraid, 
and is standing up and fighting!</i>

00:14:05.640 --> 00:14:08.690
<i>Are we dreaming?</i>

00:14:09.190 --> 00:14:11.890
<i>No, this is not a dream.</i>

00:14:11.890 --> 00:14:14.330
<i>This is reality!</i>

00:14:15.000 --> 00:14:19.230
Oh? That boy looks just like Joey...

00:14:19.840 --> 00:14:22.910
That boy... That young man...

00:14:23.340 --> 00:14:26.950
He's fighting alongside Heroman...

00:14:34.940 --> 00:14:39.080
Hey... What kind of joke is this?

00:14:42.500 --> 00:14:43.270
Hey!

00:14:45.570 --> 00:14:46.780
You knew?

00:14:59.800 --> 00:15:00.860
Damn it!

00:15:21.750 --> 00:15:24.350
Okay. It's almost time.

00:15:24.850 --> 00:15:28.360
Proceed to the next phase!

00:16:07.230 --> 00:16:10.230
How should I even describe this?

00:16:10.760 --> 00:16:14.990
The body of the mysterious 
creature has appeared!

00:16:37.090 --> 00:16:39.950
I knew it... It really is the Skrugg.

00:16:40.560 --> 00:16:43.100
I won't let what happened to 
Center City happen again here.

00:16:46.750 --> 00:16:47.690
What now?

00:17:02.980 --> 00:17:04.390
That's...

00:17:09.260 --> 00:17:10.750
The sphere from...

00:17:12.860 --> 00:17:14.250
...back then!

00:17:14.250 --> 00:17:15.890
<i>Look at that!</i>

00:17:15.890 --> 00:17:19.340
<i>Everyone in the US should 
remember that nightmare!</i>

00:17:19.940 --> 00:17:20.850
It's the sphere!

00:17:21.120 --> 00:17:24.230
The spheres that put 
humanity at its wit's end,

00:17:24.230 --> 00:17:26.310
have begun to move yet again!

00:17:29.690 --> 00:17:33.400
Look! The sphere has started to move!

00:17:33.650 --> 00:17:36.400
<i>It's floating! It's floating like a balloon!</i>

00:17:36.650 --> 00:17:40.410
<i>The sphere that trampled all over 
America is flying in the air!</i>

00:17:41.100 --> 00:17:43.650
Ooh, it's the yummy candy!

00:17:51.530 --> 00:17:53.640
<i>Joey, can you hear me? Joey!</i>

00:17:53.970 --> 00:17:54.880
Uh, yes!

00:17:55.400 --> 00:17:59.690
You've probably noticed this, but 
something has happened to the sphere!

00:17:59.690 --> 00:18:03.770
The indestructible sphere 
we couldn't analyze!

00:18:03.770 --> 00:18:05.820
<i>Yes, I saw it.</i>

00:18:05.820 --> 00:18:07.200
<i>It's floating in the sky.</i>

00:18:07.200 --> 00:18:08.440
It's not just that one, either.

00:18:08.990 --> 00:18:12.440
The same thing is happening with all 
its friends from around the world.

00:18:16.790 --> 00:18:21.930
All of them are heading 
straight for Washington D.C.

00:18:22.490 --> 00:18:25.940
<i>It's obvious the Skrugg 
are planning something.</i>

00:18:26.350 --> 00:18:30.150
Please hurry, Joey! You have to 
do something before it's too late!

00:18:30.150 --> 00:18:32.450
Please rescue the President!

00:18:32.450 --> 00:18:33.200
Right!

00:18:37.650 --> 00:18:38.800
I've got to hurry...

00:18:50.530 --> 00:18:52.220
Nothing surprises me anymore.

00:18:53.980 --> 00:18:56.230
Heroman...

00:18:56.530 --> 00:18:58.140
Attack!

00:19:17.900 --> 00:19:18.510
Now!

00:19:26.060 --> 00:19:26.890
Heroman!

00:19:36.820 --> 00:19:39.530
The NIA's power armor is awesome!

00:19:42.880 --> 00:19:45.450
Heroman...

00:19:45.740 --> 00:19:46.950
Magnecto!

00:20:04.290 --> 00:20:06.410
Heroman...

00:20:07.140 --> 00:20:08.900
Finish!

00:20:49.000 --> 00:20:49.760
Kogorr...

00:20:53.120 --> 00:20:54.650
But, how?

00:21:00.930 --> 00:21:02.230
The Skrugg!

00:21:02.230 --> 00:21:04.170
So you came, Hero?

00:21:04.170 --> 00:21:07.010
But it looks like you were a bit too late.

00:21:07.110 --> 00:21:09.650
This world will now end.

00:21:09.650 --> 00:21:13.210
It's time to resurrect our Lord, Kogorr!

00:21:35.560 --> 00:21:38.060
What the heck is that?

00:21:41.800 --> 00:21:44.440
That's... the Skrugg's...

00:21:44.990 --> 00:21:48.450
The Skrugg's true objective...

00:22:29.310 --> 00:22:32.400
<b>I want to get to know you better,</b>

00:22:32.400 --> 00:22:35.490
<b>to go at each other with our true feelings.</b>

00:22:35.490 --> 00:22:41.830
<b>Your tears and smile are both here.</b>

00:22:42.290 --> 00:22:46.260
<b>No matter how hard it is, I won't be scared any more.</b>

00:22:46.260 --> 00:22:49.320
<b>With both of us, we can go anywhere.</b>

00:22:49.320 --> 00:22:54.760
<b>Since you're the one who taught me that I'm not alone.</b>

00:22:54.760 --> 00:23:02.450
<b>Every time I mutter the words "I was born to meet you"</b>

00:23:03.120 --> 00:23:07.490
<b>my unease disappears, and my heart burns stronger.</b>

00:23:07.880 --> 00:23:14.440
<b>Thank you. We'll go on together with a sign only we understand.</b>

00:23:14.880 --> 00:23:19.300
<b>Carve out this irreplaceable time!</b>

00:23:20.540 --> 00:23:23.840
<b>I can't move away from here.</b>

00:23:23.840 --> 00:23:28.060
<b>Because I live feeling the same heartbeat.</b>

00:23:28.580 --> 00:23:30.280
<b>I want to protect you to the very last,</b>

00:23:30.280 --> 00:23:32.680
<b>to protect the promise built up.</b>

00:23:33.460 --> 00:23:40.080
<b>Thank you. We'll go on together with a sign only we understand.</b>

00:23:40.300 --> 00:23:45.810
<b>We are carving out this irreplaceable time!</b>

00:23:50.900 --> 00:23:52.490
On the next Heroman:

00:23:52.740 --> 00:23:56.250
I know. There's only one thing for us to do.

00:23:56.250 --> 00:23:58.650
Let's go, Heroman, Will!

00:23:59.090 --> 00:24:01.500
Kogorr has been resurrected,

00:24:01.500 --> 00:24:03.550
and he's an extremely powerful opponent.

00:24:03.550 --> 00:24:11.600
Joey and Heroman place everything on the line, 
knowing this battle will decide everyone's fate.

00:24:12.400 --> 00:24:15.770
Next time on Heroman #25: Crisis.

00:24:16.050 --> 00:24:18.670
Heroman... Attack!
